# Lockstep session (dungeon 1): DKSAVE99 on the map in the Harz, walk to Rammelsburg, enter the mines (a tunnel battle with doors, stairs, a chest and an exit ladder; it keeps going after a won fight). Dietrich walks west by the arrow keys into the ambush (walls open, three kobolds come), the fight is fought without orders and the loot left (L); then single file (Q: the head becomes the leader), the leader walks by the arrow keys to the doors of the side passage, U opens door 4 (with its twin 5), through, U again at door 5, back, U again at door 4, single file off (bwait:<n> = n battle passes in both games)
